Error: managed Codex Termux install not found at [CODEX_HOME]/packages/app-server-daemon/current/bin/codex

This command requires the managed install path used by the Termux package, because the daemon starts app-server from that fixed path.

Install or update it with:
  npm install -g @mmmbuto/codex-cli-termux@latest

Then rerun the command you just tried.
To work without the background server, rerun the same command with --no-daemon (including resume or fork and its arguments).
